text.section:
The governing body of any county, city, or town may by ordinance provide for the removal for safekeeping of motor vehicles, trailers, semitrailers, or parts thereof to a storage area if:

It is left unattended on a public highway or other public property and constitutes a traffic hazard;


It is illegally parked;


It is left unattended for more than 10 days either on public property or on private property without the permission of the property owner, lessee, or occupant; or


It is immobilized on a public roadway by weather conditions or other emergency situation.
